# Lavender Town (FireRed's MUS_LAVENDER, which the town and its rooms share): a slow, wistful waltz in D minor, a
# music-box celesta over a harp's rippling arpeggios and a quiet bed of strings, for the town where people come to
# remember their Pokémon. Original composition for this game (plan 19 · K5).
